  "notes": {
    "guest": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Guest purchases stay.\n\nstore.ndahiconnect.net remains a public storefront. Guests pay with a phone number and get a private tracking link, which opens the same Order tracking screen as signed-in customers.\n\nSigned-in customers shop from the Shop tab and see orders in Activity.",
      "w": 360,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 5392
    },
    "nav": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "How to try it: press Play on any screen and tap through.\n\nCustomer tabs: Home \u00b7 Internet \u00b7 Shop \u00b7 Activity \u00b7 Account.\nInternet = bundles + vouchers. Activity = bundle payments and shop orders together.\n\nSign-in uses only a PIN or a passkey \u2014 no SMS codes, no authenticator app.\n\nPrices, plan names and the pickup location are placeholders.",
      "w": 360,
      "x": 5200,
      "y": 1600
    },
    "row1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 8000,
      "text": "Desktop \u2014 customer portal with the shop inside, plus the public storefront",
