    "added": {
      "fill": "yellow",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "What changed elsewhere:\n\n\u2022 Customers: tick rows (or select all stale) \u2192 give a gift voucher or send a message in bulk.\n\u2022 Edit bundle: speed limit per customer (MikroTik queue).\n\u2022 Admin menu: Insights and Outages.\n\u2022 Buy a bundle: \"Payment didn't go through?\" link.\n\u2022 Tab bar: lang = fr.\n\nFrench check: watch button labels and the bundle card \u2014 French runs ~25% longer.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 13200
    },
    "claim": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Unregistered numbers:\n\n1. Admin \u2192 Vouchers \u2192 search a number with no account \u2192 Reserve for this number.\n2. They claim it with their number + the code (Sign in \u2192 \"Someone gave you a bundle?\").\n3. Voucher detail \u2192 Waiting for claim: change number, revoke, 90-day expiry.\n\nNo SMS: the code is the proof. Paying with Mobile Money from that number also claims it automatically.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 3760,
      "y": 13200
    }
